---
import SectionHeading from "@/components/SectionHeading.astro"

const currently = [
  "Based in NYC, between roles.",
  "Building a software design platform to help people design applications.",
  "Planning to go back to school for EE, ME, ChemE, and MatSci.",
]

const hobbies = ["Drag racing", "Sim racing", "Speedcubing", "Chess"]
---

<section id="about" class="mx-auto max-w-4xl scroll-mt-20 px-6 py-16">
  <SectionHeading eyebrow="04 / About" accent="#a0c4ff">About</SectionHeading>
  <div class="space-y-4 text-pretty text-foreground/90">
    <p>
      Software engineer based in New York. My dad handed me a programming book
      and a gaming PC at roughly the same time, which set off a long stretch of
      modding games, taking that PC apart, putting it back together, and
      eventually building a few more. After high school I decided to stop
      treating it as a hobby.
    </p>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground">
      Lately I've been spending most of my off-hours on electronics, which is
      where 3D printing and software meet for me. It started with a 3D-printed
      speaker cabinet, which made me want a real amplifier behind it, so now
      I'm building a receiver with room correction and EQ. A few other things
      in flight: another receiver for car mods like active exhaust, lighting,
      and blackout plates, an entertainment center cut open for homelab
      airflow, and an Insta360 mounted on my Mustang to film drives to and
      from meets.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-10 gap-y-8 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <h3
        class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-foreground uppercase"
      >
        <span
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#caffbf]"></span>
        Currently
      </h3>
      <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-sm text-foreground/90">
        {
          currently.map((line) => (
            <li class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true">
                ›
              </span>
              <span>{line}</span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3
        class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-foreground uppercase"
      >
        <span
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#fdffb6]"></span>
        Hobbies
      </h3>
      <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-sm text-foreground/90">
        {
          hobbies.map((line) => (
            <li class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true">
                ›
              </span>
              <span>{line}</span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
